<view class="page privacy-page">
  <view class="screen-title">隐私设置</view>
  <view class="screen-subtitle">设置每次打卡默认的位置记录方式</view>

  <view class="privacy-summary">
    <view class="summary-label">当前默认</view>
    <view class="summary-value">{{currentSummary}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title option-title">位置记录方式</view>
  <view class="card option-card">
    <view
      wx:for="{{options}}"
      wx:key="value"
      class="option-row {{item.active ? 'option-row-active' : ''}}"
      data-value="{{item.value}}"
      bindtap="selectMode"
    >
      <view class="option-copy">
        <view class="option-name">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="option-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="radio {{item.active ? 'radio-active' : ''}}"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-note">
    打卡时仍可单次修改。选择“不记录位置”时不会保存经纬度；选择“模糊位置”时会降低坐标精度。
  </view>
</view>
